{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravitation is a sandbox simulation set in the vastness of the cosmos and built on the laws of real-world physics. It offers a journey from planetary accretion and ecological evolution to the rise of civilizations, evoking a grand vision and a deep sense of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gravitation, players start as a humble meteorite drifting through the boundless universe, harnessing gravity to pull in matter, forge planets, nurture life, and ultimately lead a civilization into the interstellar era. With Survival, Challenge, and Multiplayer modes, the game invites players to confront cosmic threats and experience the epic journey from planetary birth to the emergence of life and the expansion of a civilization across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031510/extras/f6f77e1c3bf571f798e9281c151b8d53.avif?t=1767934448\" width=1560 height=1011 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031510?t=1767934448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031510/60a5a2b7d6296f2617807cc6a7bc939ef6e5776c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767934448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031510/7dd3339bbe27d63de2d1fd372cd4e593834b1d0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767934448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031510/7dd3339bbe27d63de2d1fd372cd4e593834b1d0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767934448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4031530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravitation is a sandbox simulation set in the vastness of the cosmos and built on the laws of real-world 